{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 11329286797579684084,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Run a program with Nix",
      "source_hash": 1928421660894837878,
      "context_hash": 393626559940115136,
      "translation": "Nix로 프로그램 실행하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369518Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Use the `nix run` command to run a program from [Nixpkgs](/concepts/nixpkgs)",
      "source_hash": 16084054096543856826,
      "context_hash": 7344767668069328523,
      "translation": "`nix run` 명령을 사용하여 [Nixpkgs](/concepts/nixpkgs)에서 프로그램을 실행합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nixpkgs": "Nixpkgs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Learn about Nix flakes and packages",
      "source_hash": 5964911915084510471,
      "context_hash": 12254995191044149319,
      "translation": "Nix 플레이크와 패키지에 대해 알아봅니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "flakes": "플레이크",
        "packages": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Download and run a program from Nixpkgs",
      "source_hash": 265707455165889243,
      "context_hash": 7085788970380634833,
      "translation": "Nixpkgs에서 프로그램을 다운로드하고 실행합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nixpkgs": "Nixpkgs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "In the last section, we installed Nix using the [Determinate Nix Installer][nix-installer].",
      "source_hash": 9232419826526758436,
      "context_hash": 9650439025162775578,
      "translation": "지난 절에서는 [Determinate Nix Installer][nix-installer]를 사용하여 Nix를 설치했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "nix-installer": "nix-installer",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Determinate Nix": "Determinate Nix",
        "Determinate Nix Installer": "Determinate Nix Installer"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Now we can dive in and use Nix to run an actual program.",
      "source_hash": 2957117613546090828,
      "context_hash": 899436699549859165,
      "translation": "이제 본격적으로 Nix를 사용하여 실제 프로그램을 실행해 보겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "Let's try running the delightful [ponysay]:",
      "source_hash": 11809623104103889400,
      "context_hash": 17538241784768046559,
      "translation": "사랑스러운 [ponysay]를 실행해 봅시다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": ":rocket: **Success**!",
      "source_hash": 958890450214260116,
      "context_hash": 2416364837219194535,
      "translation": ":rocket: **성공**!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "You should see a charming equine greeting in your console.",
      "source_hash": 17866069748766639727,
      "context_hash": 10199435410053371581,
      "translation": "콘솔에서 매력적인 조랑말 인사말이 보일 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "This could take a while",
      "source_hash": 10511739743794661434,
      "context_hash": 10491356742932587085,
      "translation": "시간이 좀 걸릴 수 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "The first time you run a program using `nix run` it's likely to be a slow operation.",
      "source_hash": 14574021300117284177,
      "context_hash": 13699850788032529885,
      "translation": "`nix run`을 사용하여 프로그램을 처음 실행할 때는 시간이 오래 걸리는 작업일 가능성이 높습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "That's because Nix needs to build the program's [package][packages] from scratch&mdash;or download it from a known [cache]&mdash;and store it in the [Nix store][store].",
      "source_hash": 14749792474098402184,
      "context_hash": 1757230020093806625,
      "translation": "이는 Nix가 프로그램의 [패키지][packages]를 처음부터 빌드하거나&mdash;알려진 [캐시][cache]에서 다운로드하여&mdash;[Nix 스토어][store]에 저장해야 하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "packages": "패키지",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "package": "패키지",
        "Nix store": "Nix 스토어",
        "cache": "캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:2",
      "source": "This is in contrast to most [package managers][pkg], which install things more quickly because they download pre-built archives like tarballs.",
      "source_hash": 3002213519820265057,
      "context_hash": 4166758903736929571,
      "translation": "이는 대부분의 [패키지 관리자][pkg]와는 대조적인데, 이들은 tarball과 같은 미리 빌드된 아카이브를 다운로드하기 때문에 더 빠르게 설치됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "package managers": "패키지 관리자",
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369521Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:3",
      "source": "Future `nix run` invocations should be instantaneous, as Nix doesn't need to build the package again.",
      "source_hash": 8613575890953150218,
      "context_hash": 13099626171348625339,
      "translation": "이후의 `nix run` 실행은 Nix가 패키지를 다시 빌드할 필요가 없으므로 즉시 실행될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "package": "패키지",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369521Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Explanation",
      "source_hash": 5181673655385837706,
      "context_hash": 5610968122860088988,
      "translation": "설명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369521Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "What happened here?",
      "source_hash": 14931159192695298320,
      "context_hash": 1426570144542046041,
      "translation": "여기서 무슨 일이 일어난 것일까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369521Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The [Nix] CLI did a few things:",
      "source_hash": 6023427055946682551,
      "context_hash": 5141129481552094286,
      "translation": "[Nix] CLI는 몇 가지 작업을 수행했습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369521Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "It used the `nixpkgs` [flake reference][ref] to pull in some Nix code and targeted the `ponysay` [flake output][output] (more on this later).",
      "source_hash": 1081831197852877993,
      "context_hash": 1149652896804436313,
      "translation": "`nixpkgs` [플레이크 참조][ref]를 사용하여 Nix 코드를 가져오고 `ponysay` [플레이크 출력][output]을 대상으로 지정했습니다(이에 대해서는 나중에 더 자세히 다룹니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "output": "출력",
        "flake": "플레이크",
        "flake reference": "플레이크 참조"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369522Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "It built the [`ponysay` package][ponysay] and stored the result in the [Nix store][store].",
      "source_hash": 3510147685300777562,
      "context_hash": 9515589365662925206,
      "translation": "[`ponysay` 패키지][ponysay]를 빌드하고 그 결과를 [Nix 스토어][store]에 저장했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix store": "Nix 스토어",
        "package": "패키지",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369522Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "It ran the executable at `bin/ponysay` from the `ponysay` package.",
      "source_hash": 17893560602229813552,
      "context_hash": 2798096796842866035,
      "translation": "`ponysay` 패키지에서 `bin/ponysay`에 있는 실행 파일을 실행했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369522Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "In Nix, every program is part of a [package][packages].",
      "source_hash": 14264272170150997329,
      "context_hash": 17838595539461048230,
      "translation": "Nix에서는 모든 프로그램이 [패키지][packages]의 일부입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "packages": "패키지",
        "package": "패키지",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369522Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Packages are built using the [Nix language][derivations].",
      "source_hash": 7895196147587590982,
      "context_hash": 17683970781121719527,
      "translation": "패키지는 [Nix 언어][derivations]를 사용하여 빌드됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Nix language": "Nix 언어",
        "packages": "패키지",
        "derivations": "derivation"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369522Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "The `ponysay` package has a single program (also called `ponysay`) but packages can contain multiple programs as well as man pages, configuration files, and more.",
      "source_hash": 16117526553040812918,
      "context_hash": 437926595699686761,
      "translation": "`ponysay` 패키지에는 (역시 `ponysay`라고 불리는) 프로그램이 하나 있지만, 패키지는 여러 프로그램뿐만 아니라 man 페이지, 설정 파일 등도 포함할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "packages": "패키지",
        "package": "패키지",
        "configuration": "설정"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369523Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:3",
      "source": "The [`ffmpeg`][ffmpeg-pkg] package, for example, provides both [ffmpeg] and [ffprobe].",
      "source_hash": 7065803883493104994,
      "context_hash": 8857053294818828530,
      "translation": "예를 들어 [`ffmpeg`][ffmpeg-pkg] 패키지는 [ffmpeg]와 [ffprobe]를 모두 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369991Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Install and run in one command",
      "source_hash": 2863875541835980869,
      "context_hash": 15216301492517921411,
      "translation": "한 명령으로 설치와 실행을 동시에",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369995Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "You may have noticed that [`nix run`][nix-run] doesn't require anything like a `nix install` command.",
      "source_hash": 6289059117404765222,
      "context_hash": 1614730683744809053,
      "translation": "[`nix run`][nix-run]에는 `nix install` 명령 같은 것이 전혀 필요하지 않다는 점을 눈치채셨을 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369996Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "This makes it handy for use cases like shell scripting or experimenting with in-progress tools.",
      "source_hash": 14852570864895089053,
      "context_hash": 3837976840626358081,
      "translation": "이 덕분에 셸 스크립팅이나 개발 중인 도구를 실험해 보는 등의 사용 사례에서 유용하게 활용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369997Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "For more on `nix run`, see [Using Nix to run software with no installation steps][nix-run-post] on the [Determinate Systems blog][blog].",
      "source_hash": 8818747831636571634,
      "context_hash": 1307014017889276144,
      "translation": "`nix run`에 대해 더 알아보려면 [Determinate Systems 블로그][blog]의 [Using Nix to run software with no installation steps][nix-run-post]를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Determinate Systems": "Determinate Systems",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369998Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "**Congrats**!",
      "source_hash": 5607200587146130257,
      "context_hash": 12709989281104495921,
      "translation": "**축하합니다**!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.369999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "You've just run a program using the Nix CLI and learned a little bit about some core Nix concepts.",
      "source_hash": 16781590605910993620,
      "context_hash": 1012873819222939775,
      "translation": "방금 Nix CLI를 사용하여 프로그램을 실행했고, 몇 가지 핵심 Nix 개념에 대해 조금 배웠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Nix CLI": "Nix CLI"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:2",
      "source": "You're now ready to explore Nix development environments.",
      "source_hash": 2011757624812809321,
      "context_hash": 6751161625250783567,
      "translation": "이제 Nix 개발 환경을 탐구할 준비가 되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "development environments": "개발 환경",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:55.370001Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}